[agent] ## Summary
[agent] **Feature pipeline** (model-independent FE in pandas → platform feature groups):
[agent] - **`cctxnfe5424`** (v1) — engineered fraud features per transaction: amount/log-amount, hour & night flag, **transaction velocity** (count in 1h/24h windows), **time since previous txn**, **geo distance from previous txn & from card's usual location** (haversine), **impossible-travel speed**, **amount z-score** vs card history, and category fraud rate. 24,115 rows + `is_fraud` label. All lookback features use only prior rows per card (no same-row leakage).
[agent] - **`ccscorefe5424`** (v1) — identical features for the 5,293 unlabelled scoring rows (lookback computed over train+score history so velocity/geo are correct).
[agent] **Training dataset**: feature view **`cctdfe5424`** (v1) over `cctxnfe5424` with `is_fraud` label, plus a materialized training-dataset version.
